{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "anglerfish-fusion-cue-1",
      "transcript": "Some fish physically fuse with their mates.",
      "file": "audio/anglerfish-fusion/narration/cue-1.wav",
      "start": 0,
      "duration": 2.65,
      "beatIndex": 0,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "anglerfish-fusion.asset.permanent-pair.script.1",
      "samples": 63600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "anglerfish-fusion-cue-2",
      "transcript": "In the deep sea, a tiny male searches for a much larger female.",
      "file": "audio/anglerfish-fusion/narration/cue-2.wav",
      "start": 2.8,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "beatIndex": 1,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "anglerfish-fusion.asset.permanent-pair.script.2",
      "samples": 105600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "anglerfish-fusion-cue-3",
      "transcript": "This is the triplewart seadevil.",
      "file": "audio/anglerfish-fusion/narration/cue-3.wav",
      "start": 7.333333333333333,
      "duration": 2.475,
      "beatIndex": 2,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "anglerfish-fusion.asset.permanent-pair.script.3",
      "samples": 59400,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "anglerfish-fusion-cue-4",
      "transcript": "He grips her skin with hooked teeth. In this species, attachment becomes permanent.",
      "file": "audio/anglerfish-fusion/narration/cue-4.wav",
      "start": 9.966666666666667,
      "duration": 5.375,
      "beatIndex": 3,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "anglerfish-fusion.asset.permanent-pair.script.4",
      "samples": 129000,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "anglerfish-fusion-cue-5",
      "transcript": "Over time, their tissues join. Blood vessels connect.",
      "file": "audio/anglerfish-fusion/narration/cue-5.wav",
      "start": 15.533333333333333,
      "duration": 3.675,
      "beatIndex": 4,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "anglerfish-fusion.asset.permanent-pair.script.5",
      "samples": 88200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "anglerfish-fusion-cue-6",
      "transcript": "Her blood supplies his nutrients, while his testes develop to produce sperm.",
      "file": "audio/anglerfish-fusion/narration/cue-6.wav",
      "start": 19.566666666666666,
      "duration": 5.025,
      "beatIndex": 5,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "anglerfish-fusion.asset.permanent-pair.script.6",
      "samples": 120600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "anglerfish-fusion-cue-7",
      "transcript": "He doesn't disappear into her. He remains an attached male.",
      "file": "audio/anglerfish-fusion/narration/cue-7.wav",
      "start": 24.766666666666666,
      "duration": 3.75,
      "beatIndex": 6,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "anglerfish-fusion.asset.permanent-pair.script.7",
      "samples": 90000,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "anglerfish-fusion-cue-8",
      "transcript": "How can foreign tissues coexist? These fish have lost key parts of adaptive immunity.",
      "file": "audio/anglerfish-fusion/narration/cue-8.wav",
      "start": 28.666666666666668,
      "duration": 5.65,
      "beatIndex": 7,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "anglerfish-fusion.asset.permanent-pair.script.8",
      "samples": 135600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "anglerfish-fusion-cue-9",
      "transcript": "Exactly how their remaining defenses work is still being studied.",
      "file": "audio/anglerfish-fusion/narration/cue-9.wav",
      "start": 34.46666666666667,
      "duration": 4.3,
      "beatIndex": 8,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "anglerfish-fusion.asset.permanent-pair.script.9",
      "samples": 103200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "anglerfish-fusion-cue-10",
      "transcript": "In a world where mates are hard to find, staying together may secure future spawning.",
      "file": "audio/anglerfish-fusion/narration/cue-10.wav",
      "start": 38.9,
      "duration": 5.25,
      "beatIndex": 9,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "anglerfish-fusion.asset.permanent-pair.script.10",
      "samples": 126000,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "anglerfish-fusion-cue-11",
      "transcript": "Two fish. A lasting connection.",
      "file": "audio/anglerfish-fusion/narration/cue-11.wav",
      "start": 44.36666666666667,
      "duration": 2.525,
      "beatIndex": 10,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "anglerfish-fusion.asset.permanent-pair.script.11",
      "samples": 60600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    }
  ],
